      'Currently, I am part of the development of a financial planning platform for Findeter, aimed at projecting financial scenarios over 15 years. This system models complex variables such as external debt, investments, cash flow, bonds, active portfolio, foreign currency operations, payroll, and loans. My role focuses on fullstack development of critical functionalities and building a robust architecture capable of supporting large volumes of data and strategic financial calculations.',
    ],
    outro: 'A lo largo de estos proyectos, he trabajado con tecnologías como Next.js, NestJS, TypeORM, PostgreSQL, Angular, .NET Core, SQL Server, Redis, Amazon SQS, Supabase, Azure Blob Storage y Python, fortaleciendo mis habilidades en diseño de sistemas escalables, optimización de rendimiento y desarrollo orientado a impacto.',
    outroEn: 'Throughout these projects, I have worked with technologies such as Next.js, NestJS, TypeORM, PostgreSQL, Angular, .NET Core, SQL Server, Redis, Amazon SQS, Supabase, Azure Blob Storage, and Python, strengthening my skills in scalable system design, performance optimization, and impact-driven development.',
